Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.82,0:00:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Utah, Mudron!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.66,0:00:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mudron!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.26,0:00:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ohhhhhhhh!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.76,0:00:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems I was right\Nabout the world's speed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and power exceeding that of Star Platinum,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.58,0:00:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.78,0:00:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's nothing left to do\Nbut bring this game to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.54,0:00:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should have been done ages ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.56,0:00:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'll finally be rid of\Nyou Joestars once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.62,0:00:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using the power of my stand, I\Nwill send you all into oblivion!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.04,0:00:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the world will stop time itself!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.53,0:00:54.36,SC Opening 2 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,952.999)}Seeking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.72,0:01:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the end of the day, they'll be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.96,0:01:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ruined my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.70,0:01:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I brought you to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.48,0:01:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't know what a must.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.04,0:01:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still seeing the fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.90,0:01:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fate of a mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.46,0:01:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,End of the world.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.96,0:02:34.25,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(985,555)\pos(132,890)}Episode 47: Dio's World, Part 3
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.72,0:02:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, your exasperating family line is\Njust moments away from being eradicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.00,0:02:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hundred-year struggle with\Nthe Josars ends with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.04,0:02:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Begone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.56,0:03:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He moved his finger, but how?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.50,0:03:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.88,0:03:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He shouldn't be able to\Nthink, let alone move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.24,0:03:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, there's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.26,0:03:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is his power
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.74,0:03:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the same as the world's?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.08,0:03:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your stand has a lot in\Ncommon with my Star Platinum.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.10,0:03:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he mean the world and Star\NPlatinum are the same type of stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.60,0:03:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you see me right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.44,0:03:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you consciously moving, or\Nis it an involuntary twitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.64,0:03:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, time's up.
