Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.58,0:03:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, could you see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.76,0:03:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must I repeat?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.00,0:04:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I asked if you could follow my movements!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.68,0:04:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.80,0:04:03.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not making sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.34,0:04:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Need to have your eyes checked, D .O.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.82,0:04:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.22,0:04:16.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't run forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.74,0:04:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seeing me isn't going to do you any\Ngood when time is standing still!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.92,0:04:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If your Stone does bear\Nsimilarities to mine, prove it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.46,0:04:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to see just how\Nmuch we have in common!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.68,0:04:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.59,0:04:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been six months since I began\Nto grasp the art of stopping time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.72,0:04:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To test the world's speed and power,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.46,0:04:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I commanded my servant to take\Naim point-blank, right at my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.00,0:04:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for a moment, it looked as\Nthough time itself had stood still.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.38,0:04:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought for sure I was hallucinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.10,0:04:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seemed like the vision a boxer has when\Nhis opponent's punches linger in mid-air.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.08,0:05:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That second felt like an eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.08,0:05:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I wasn't simply imagining things.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.86,0:05:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stand was actually\Nable to move between the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.66,0:05:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hovering bullets that\Nwere suspended in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.76,0:05:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it could grasp them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.68,0:05:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Lord D .O.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.12,0:05:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are well on your way to\Nbeing the master of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.10,0:05:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next step is willing yourself to\Nmove through the realm of frozen time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.48,0:05:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must happen as naturally as breathing,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.16,0:05:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or as nonchalantly as snapping a\Npencil betwixt your mighty fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.42,0:05:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must think of it\Nas completely ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.18,0:05:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The most important thing is\Nhaving faith in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.30,0:05:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's imperative that you find the\Nmental fortitude to steal your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.00,0:05:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the one true ruler of this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.82,0:05:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Controlling time should\Nbe second nature to you!
