Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.48,0:06:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then one day, I sensed the wheels of time\Nand the world interlock at long last.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.32,0:06:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like a ray of clarity dispersing the\Nshadows in my mind, a revelation befell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.06,0:06:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was Dio, and my destiny was to surpass\Nall living things, including stand-users!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.34,0:06:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can stop time for five seconds. And the\Ntime limit keeps extending by the day now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.68,0:06:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, you're about to\Nexperience just how weak you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.14,0:06:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to make good on my promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.22,0:06:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world grinds to a halt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.14,0:07:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see you planted a magnet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.10,0:07:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must have been when we\Nwere exchanging glows.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.80,0:07:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like a wallet magnet or\None picked from a pocket planner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.30,0:07:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to admit, you had me fooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.98,0:07:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a clever boy indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.56,0:07:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, if you have to resort\Nto inane tricks like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.84,0:07:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It only proves that you can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.38,0:07:22.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while time is standing still.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.32,0:07:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've only postponed the\Ninevitable by a few seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.54,0:07:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.90,0:07:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die, Jotaro!
