Dialogue: 2,0:07:38.68,0:07:38.72,SFXThing,4,0,0,0,,{=4}{\bord0\blur1.1\frz17.32\pos(1325.2,597.6)\4a&HFF&\fscx120}K{*\c&HA254AE&}a{*\c&H9A56B3&}b{*\c&H9359B8&}o{*\c&H8B5BBD&}o{\c&H845DC2&}m
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:40.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.68,0:07:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.94,0:07:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, he's moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.52,0:07:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What nerve, although he\Ncan only do it briefly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.32,0:07:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The magnet wasn't meant to\Nmake me think he could move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.40,0:07:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was made to make me think he couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.60,0:08:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, it was a trap designed\Nto lure me in, and I fell for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.22,0:08:03.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The key is believing that your\Npower is completely ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.72,0:08:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Disgusting, to think that\Nmy domain could be invaded,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.64,0:08:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And by one of the Joestars, no less!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.52,0:08:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's infuriating!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.14,0:08:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was able to move for a second there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.52,0:08:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.00,0:08:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, that's not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.18,0:08:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would only give me enough\Ntime for a single punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.76,0:08:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You there, woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.28,0:08:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about you make yourself\Nuseful and fetch me my leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.68,0:08:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring it here this instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.28,0:08:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imagine you're a flight attendant bringing\Ncaviar to a passenger in first class!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.24,0:08:58.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it gets you here faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.34,0:09:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well that's good to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.82,0:09:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems I'll have to blow your head\Noff to do any significant damage!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.26,0:09:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.17,0:09:17.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've already siphoned off\Nenough energy to heal yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.42,0:09:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like that gaping hole I opened\Nin your gut was never even there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.24,0:09:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your eyes followed me even\Nwhile time was frozen!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.40,0:09:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which confirms that you\Ncan see my movements?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.40,0:09:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.50,0:09:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nervous yet, sweetheart? Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.04,0:09:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, did you quite the favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.12,0:09:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of his brilliant mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.10,0:09:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was able to correctly\Ndeduce the world's secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.58,0:09:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And because he passed\Nthat knowledge along,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.90,0:09:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You figured out that I\Ncould stop time at will?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.14,0:09:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and worked until you learned\Nhow to do it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.98,0:09:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then again,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.02,0:09:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you haven't had as much\Ntraining as I have,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.26,0:10:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'm curious to know exactly how\Nlong you can move while time is frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.68,0:10:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two seconds? Or maybe three?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.14,0:10:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps you can move\Nfive seconds like me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.80,0:10:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you're pretending you can't\Nto gain some kind of an advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.26,0:10:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.74,0:10:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.70,0:10:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.38,0:10:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could probably move longer if I\Nwas able to get some practice in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.30,0:10:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as it stands, the\Nbest I can do is a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.02,0:10:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I was forced to make a guess, I'd\Nsay you could only move for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.84,0:10:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be that as it may, you've still\Nmanaged to infiltrate my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.46,0:10:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only a fool would risk approaching\Nyou now, and though I'm many things,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.42,0:10:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a fool wouldn't be considered one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.68,0:10:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While it's achingly clear that my\Nadvantage over you is overwhelming...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.54,0:10:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've still devised a way to execute you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.10,0:10:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So regardless of how long you can move in\Nmy world, you'll never escape your demise!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.60,0:10:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're white as a sheet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.18,0:10:57.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do these bring back memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.00,0:10:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do they remind you that\Nyou're going to die a death
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.96,0:11:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even more horrific than\Nyour pathetic grandfather?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.26,0:11:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screw this bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.82,0:11:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell does he come\Nup with this kind of shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.04,0:11:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.66,0:11:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.14,0:11:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.46,0:11:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five seconds left.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.60,0:11:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think your star platinum can deflect\Nall of the knives once time resumes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.64,0:11:38.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I were a betting man, I'd give that\Nplan a one in a million chance of working.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.58,0:11:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.54,0:11:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be terrifying to stare Death\Nin the face and be helpless to stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.38,0:11:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only three seconds remain!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.14,0:11:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're down to two seconds?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.26,0:12:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me that's\Nthe best you've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.80,0:12:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just more evidence of your ineptitude\Nin the presence of one such as myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.24,0:12:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One second left to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.26,0:12:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.92,0:12:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.32,0:12:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But one can never be too careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.18,0:12:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, to be perfectly honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.38,0:12:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm relieved I was able to do\Naway with you so quickly, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.44,0:12:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.96,0:12:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never would have thought that you'd have\Nthe power to infiltrate my perfect world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.58,0:12:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A fitting analogy would be the automobile.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.46,0:12:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Useful machines until the roads\Nbecome clogged with them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.42,0:13:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but the Mantle of Master\Nof Time is reserved for me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.72,0:13:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.88,0:13:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd throw enough knives or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.98,0:13:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean he'd turn my favorite\Nuniform into Swiss cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.44,0:13:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm glad I decided to stuff my\Nclothes with magazines. I figured it was
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.42,0:13:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,only a matter of time before he tried\Nthrowing weapons but I didn't expect
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.68,0:13:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that many my best bet right now is to\Nplay possum and wait for a chance to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.64,0:13:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take dio by surprise since he can\Nregenerate I've got to Bash his brains in,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.26,0:13:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or else he'll never die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.28,0:14:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe I'll do one more\Ncheck for good measure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.60,0:14:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Joestars have a way of\Ncoming back from the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.48,0:14:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's a chance Jotaro\Nis putting on this death act.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.44,0:14:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to make sure he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.86,0:14:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.50,0:14:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.16,0:14:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To sever that troublesome head of his!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.24,0:14:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for you to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.16,0:14:32.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.22,0:14:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only one dying here is you!
