Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.84,0:14:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's gonna die! Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.56,0:15:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time has stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.34,0:15:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get a good look at your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.60,0:15:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.08,0:15:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.08,0:15:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now time will resume.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.16,0:15:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.52,0:15:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a shame, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.58,0:15:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were so close, but dropped the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.18,0:15:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you'd lunged with more\Nforce behind your attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.10,0:15:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you could have eviscerated my brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.00,0:15:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,beyond the point of regeneration.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.32,0:15:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.98,0:15:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.80,0:15:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When will you all accept\Nthat you cannot kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.04,0:15:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are nothing more than pawns\Ndestined to be put in check.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.44,0:15:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your death brings about the end of\Nthe Joestar's tragic Egyptian journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.88,0:15:52.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.79,0:15:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't do something,\NPolnareff's as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.44,0:15:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was gonna keep up this act until I had a
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.56,0:16:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,chance to catch him off\Nguard and crush his skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.74,0:16:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But saving Polnareff from this United\Nfreak is more important right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.16,0:16:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not gonna be easy, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.24,0:16:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't make the mistake of\Ncrossing into Star Platinum's range,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.24,0:16:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it'll just end up like\Nthe last time he trapped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.84,0:16:18.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever I do, I can't\Nlet him know I'm alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.82,0:16:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as he thinks I'm dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.56,0:16:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have the element of surprise, which\Ngives me a chance to get in close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.16,0:16:27.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strange how things end\Nup coming full circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.90,0:16:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One minute I'm trying to will myself\Nto move through a world of frozen time,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.70,0:16:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the next I'm doing everything\NI can to stay completely still.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.02,0:16:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enjoy your journey to the afterlife!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.64,0:16:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.86,0:16:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was he alive all along?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.80,0:16:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the very least, he\Nseems to be coming, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.88,0:16:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.30,0:16:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the police!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.70,0:17:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You try anything funny and we will shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.14,0:17:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slowly put your hands in the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.34,0:17:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, what impeccable timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.10,0:17:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wouldn't mind, there's\Nsomebody I'd like for you to shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.34,0:17:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see that man lying on the\Nground? Shoot his leg or torso?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.62,0:17:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.53,0:17:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Line up the shot and let the bullet fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.40,0:17:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I heard Jotaro\Nmake a sound a moment ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.86,0:17:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I guess my mind was\Nplaying tricks on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.34,0:17:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could he be any more demented?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.02,0:17:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's at least lost interest in Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.00,0:17:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now that his attention's back\Non me, he's even more suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.98,0:17:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not gonna rest\Nuntil he's sure I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.66,0:17:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things just got a lot harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.02,0:17:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.78,0:18:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't we check his breathing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.10,0:18:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.08,0:18:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not breathing, but there's\Nno way to hide his heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.88,0:18:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit, this hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.42,0:18:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I black out, everything we've been\Nthrough will have been for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.54,0:18:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dying because I used my\Nown stand to stop my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.94,0:18:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be ironic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.38,0:18:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a morbid kind of way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.58,0:18:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And sure enough there's no\Nheartbeat. What do you know, I.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.86,0:18:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,suppose the thought of him being\Nalive was just a figment of my
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.62,0:18:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,imagination though stranger things\Nhave happened so i should still
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.70,0:19:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,probably lop off his head to be\Nsure that's not a problem is it
