Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.32,0:19:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to stop time again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.56,0:19:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.58,0:19:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta hand it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.30,0:19:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really put me through hell back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.40,0:19:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not stopping time or\Nleaving with your skull intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.50,0:19:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.80,0:19:35.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.76,0:19:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.98,0:19:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.08,0:19:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally got to run my fist\Nstraight through his demented skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.44,0:19:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that walking cesspool of evil lived at\Nthe bottom of the sea for over a century.
