Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.38,0:20:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will annihilate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.12,0:20:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.68,0:20:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.48,0:20:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, what did you do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.14,0:20:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have control over my legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.52,0:20:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't even stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.48,0:20:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My head!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.78,0:20:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pain is unbearable!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.70,0:20:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unbearable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.61,0:20:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'm going to vomit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.10,0:20:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.04,0:20:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the pinnacle of perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.62,0:20:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He actually damaged my\Nbrain and paralyzed my legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.28,0:20:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit, shit, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.86,0:20:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to find a way out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.60,0:20:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've doused you with\Ngasoline so you can't hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.24,0:20:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Normally I would hate to kick a\Nguy when he's down on his luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.40,0:20:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, with you, I don't give a damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.44,0:20:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You killed my friends and\Ncountless innocent bystanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.58,0:21:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So don't expect any mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.62,0:21:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come forth, the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.54,0:21:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can just make it a little farther
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.76,0:21:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now time will flow as usual
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.30,0:21:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While he had his ear to the ground he\Nwas also listening for any nearby cars?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.82,0:21:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clever, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.30,0:21:45.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard's not getting away that easily!
