Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.66,0:21:57.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almost...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.64,0:21:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.70,0:22:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.98,0:22:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.42,0:22:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.86,0:22:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got unfinished business.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.66,0:22:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.20,0:22:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.68,0:22:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world! Free!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.92,0:22:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fell for it, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.30,0:22:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now my victory is all but assured!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.06,0:22:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once again, my genius\Nhas triumphed over you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.68,0:22:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does this street look familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.80,0:23:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This street...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.14,0:23:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have I done?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.76,0:23:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.20,0:23:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was my escape route\Nto your grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.66,0:23:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now his blood is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.18,0:23:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T .O.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.18,0:23:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dead!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.50,0:23:28.51,Next Episode,,0,0,0,,{\fs120\pos(960,730)}Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.20,0:23:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.42,0:23:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been quite the journey, eh, my boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.16,0:23:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blood of the Joestars\Ncourses through my veins!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.18,0:23:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blood of the Joestars\Ncourses through my veins!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.14,0:23:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This whole thing might have ended\Ndifferently, but you wouldn't piss me off.
